{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"bj8_0ve_x8r","canonical_person_id":"bj8_0ve_x8r","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["bj8_0ve_x8r"],"persons":[{"id":"bj8_0ve_x8r","label":"劉頌〔華譚同郡、晉廷尉〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"劉頌","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan","quote":"劉頌"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"劉頌〔華譚同郡、晉廷尉〕，見本組原文及身份互校。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-052-hua-tan-ws2604575","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-052","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-052-hua-tan-ws2604575"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"劉頌","kind":"person","person_id":"bj8_0ve_x8r","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p008","text":"時九州秀孝策無逮譚者。譚素以才學為東土所推。同郡劉頌時為廷尉，見之歎息曰：「不悟鄉里乃有如此才也！」博士王濟于眾中嘲之曰：「五府初開，群公辟命，采英奇於仄陋，拔賢俊於岩穴。君吳、楚之人，亡國之余，有何秀異而應斯舉？」譚答曰：「秀異固產于方外，不出於中域也。是以明珠文貝，生於江、鬱之濱；夜光之璞，出乎荊、藍之下。故以人求之，文王生於東夷，大禹生於西羌。子弗聞乎？昔武王克商，遷殷頑民於洛邑，諸君得非其苗裔乎？」濟又曰：「夫危而不持，顛而不扶，至於君臣失位，國亡無主，凡在冠帶，將何所取哉！」答曰：「籲！存亡有運，興衰有期，天之所廢，人不能支。徐偃修仁義而失國，仲尼逐魯而逼齊，段幹偃息而成名，諒否泰有時，曷人力之所能哉！」濟甚禮之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":72,"last_line":72,"raw_start":7084,"raw_end":7400,"raw_character_offsets":[7084,7085,7086,7087,7088,7089,7090,7091,7092,7093,7094,7095,7096,7097,7098,7099,7100,7101,7102,7103,7104,7105,7106,7107,7108,7109,7110,7111,7112,7113,7114,7115,7116,7117,7118,7119,7120,7121,7122,7123,7124,7125,7126,7127,7128,7129,7130,7131,7132,7133,7134,7135,7136,7137,7138,7139,7140,7141,7142,7143,7144,7145,7146,7147,7148,7149,7150,7151,7152,7153,7154,7155,7156,7157,7158,7159,7160,7161,7162,7163,7164,7165,7166,7167,7168,7169,7170,7171,7172,7173,7174,7175,7176,7177,7178,7179,7180,7181,7182,7183,7184,7185,7186,7187,7188,7189,7190,7191,7192,7193,7194,7195,7196,7197,7198,7199,7200,7201,7202,7203,7204,7205,7206,7207,7208,7209,7210,7211,7212,7213,7214,7215,7216,7217,7218,7219,7220,7221,7222,7223,7224,7225,7226,7227,7228,7229,7230,7231,7232,7233,7234,7235,7236,7237,7238,7239,7240,7241,7242,7243,7244,7245,7246,7247,7248,7249,7250,7251,7252,7253,7254,7255,7256,7257,7258,7259,7260,7261,7262,7263,7264,7265,7266,7267,7268,7269,7270,7271,7272,7273,7274,7275,